Falsifies `jh7110_clock_and_reset::verification::a_clock_offset_is_one_of_the_domains_own_words`.

The defect: the bound is off by one (`>` for `>=`), so the index one past the last clock is given
an offset, which is the first word of whatever follows the clock words.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(index < domain.clocks)` on a returned offset.

